CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_7548f528e6b9", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-SAmerica-1oct09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-SAmerica-1oct09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 237282, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "October 2009          © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential    Chilean copper concentrate grades: less but not least  It is a widely discussed topic in the copper industry that concentrates grades have been decreasing.   Smelters argue that the standard 30% grade is rare these days.  In the latest Copper Concentrates Service  report we have analysed the monthly Chilean copper concentrate g", char_count: 17331});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_47c698ce2d82", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-SAmerica-26nov09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-SAmerica-26nov09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 172851, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "December 2009          © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential    SAG mills: to GMD or not to GMD  SAG mills with Gearless Mill Drives (GMD) have marked the advent of large scale milling optimisation,  but they have also presented a major source of potential risk to mine-plant throughput. For example, in  2008-2009, the Laguna Seca concentrator at Escondida, which processes between 35-40% of", char_count: 18791});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_a8786cc52281", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-SAmerica-2nov09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-SAmerica-2nov09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 179930, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "November 2009          © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential    Legally striking  CRU anticipated that in Q4 2009 there was going to be turmoil regarding negotiations of collective labour  agreements at several major copper mine operations.  A few weeks ago, the attention was focused on the  start-up of negotiations at BHP Billiton’s Spence mine as it was expected to set a precedent for fu", char_count: 19495});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_491cbce9b158", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-SAmerica-3sep09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-SAmerica-3sep09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 284455, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "September 2009         © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential    Will the greenfields of Peru replace the brownfields of Chile? - Profiling  the next generation of copper mine projects  The rebound in the copper price has been encouraging companies to take a second look at their project  portfolios.  Some major companies have announced new discoveries, while some juniors are seeking  financ", char_count: 18536});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_3f0f514403a3", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-SAmerica-7aug09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-SAmerica-7aug09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 159751, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "August 2009          © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential    Lower copper grades, not just a hidden problem  During July and August, Escondida’s Laguna Seca SAG mill has been under a 45-day stoppage in order  for repairs to be undertaken.  This SAG mill problem combined with lower copper grades are the reasons  for a 37% drop in Escondida’s copper in concentrate production in Q2 2009.  Lo", char_count: 18208});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_c4a2b461b8c0", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-Studies-mining-21sep09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-Studies-mining-21sep09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 363269, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "         © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential     www.crumonitor.com                                 Measuring and mitigating risk in mining  operations   page 2  CRU Strategies has developed an approach to identify and measure the risks  that cause business variability.  The most important risks of the operation are  identified in order to measure their impact and identify possible mitig", char_count: 20000});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_0f67f0387400", name_ru: "CRU-Cu-wire-monit-1jul09.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о меди/CRU/CRU-Cu-wire-monit-1jul09.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 668925, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "July 2009    Page 1 of 12  © 2009 CRU International Limited confidential  www.crugroup.com      Green Shoots or a False Dawn?   After a very poor Q1 things have only marginally improved in Q2. Our initial estimate is that  copper wirerod consumption fell by 11.8% in H1 compared to H1 2008, with wire and cable  production 11.7% lower, with the rate of decline just under 10% in Q2. The winding wire", char_count: 20000});
