CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_0a1c9d2fced4", name_ru: "PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunExecSum.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunExecSum.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 121593, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "  Precious Metals Quarterly 2012 Q2  CRU International Limited confidential  Executive summary  Gold: nearing its peak  After two years of rapid expansion, the gold market surplus dropped to 1,138 tonnes in 2011.   This is 21% lower than in 2010, and reflects increased purchases by the official sector and lower  scrap supplies alongside a fabrication demand that was largely flat.   Although gold ", char_count: 11443});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_ce088b009492", name_ru: "PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunReport.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunReport.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 2147270, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "                          Precious Metals  Market Outlook  Quarterly – 2012 Q2                      31 Mount Pleasant, London WC1X OAD  Tel: +44 (0)20 7903 2000  Fax: +44 (0)20 7837 0976   Website: www.crugroup.com    This report is supplied on a private and confidential basis to the customer.  Its contents  must not be disclosed to any other company, organisation or individual, nor be  photocopie", char_count: 20000});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_2725097589e8", name_ru: "AppxA.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunChapters/AppxA.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 270201, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "Precious Metals Quarterly 2012 Q2  CRU International Limited confidential  Appendix A  Industrial and  economic outlook,  2012-16  1.  Risks mount in the Eurozone and China    The Eurozone is back where it was at the end of 2011, with the added burden of greatly  amplified political uncertainty.  The election in Greece on 6 May completed the unravelling  triggered by Spain’s reappraisal of its bud", char_count: 20000});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_7c0f6d9e2d7d", name_ru: "Ch1_Au.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunChapters/Ch1_Au.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 758502, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "  Precious Metals Quarterly 2012 Q2  CRU International Limited confidential  Chapter 1  Gold  1.  Summary  The year 2011 marked a decade since the gold market balance shifted into fundamental  surplus.  The size of the surplus, however, did not expand last year as it did in 2010 and most  notably in 2009, but actually dropped by 21% to 1,138 tonnes.  One key factor behind this radical end to expan", char_count: 20000});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_48359c333ac1", name_ru: "Ch2_Ag.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunChapters/Ch2_Ag.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 377153, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "  Precious Metals Quarterly 2012 Q2  CRU International Limited confidential  Chapter 2  Silver  Renewed economic slowdown has taken its toll on silver  Global economic growth has continued to slow during the last three months and this has had  further repercussions for silver.  We already knew that fabrication demand was beginning to be  curtailed in the second half of last year and evidence is po", char_count: 20000});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_80c0385a1f4b", name_ru: "Ch3_Pt.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunChapters/Ch3_Pt.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 296268, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "  Precious Metals Quarterly 2012 Q2  CRU International Limited confidential  Chapter 3  Platinum  Good performance comes at a high price  As of the end of the third week of June, platinum was trading 4% higher than this year’s  opening London fix of $1,406/oz, making this the best-performing precious metal during the  first half of 2012.  In fact, platinum is the only precious metal to have demons", char_count: 20000});
CREATE (:Entity:Publication {id: "doc_198dc2eae4b0", name_ru: "Ch4_Pd.pdf", path: "Материалы конференций/Источники данных о МПГ/Квартальные издания/CRU/2012/Jun 2012/PreciousMetalsQuarterly2012JunChapters/Ch4_Pd.pdf", category: "Материалы конференций", ext: "pdf", size_bytes: 244318, sensitivity: "public", confidence: "verified", deep_parsed: true, geography: "International", snippet: "  Precious Metals Quarterly 2012 Q2  CRU International Limited confidential  Chapter 4  Palladium  Price retreats despite positive fundamentals  Palladium’s price has been very choppy so far in 2012.  After receiving a heavy beating in  the second half of 2011, the metal started 2012 in an upbeat mood with prices climbing on the  back of a combination of supply concerns and improved auto sales in ", char_count: 20000});
